     <abstract pn="section-abstract">
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This RFC reports on the status of most Network Hosts from June 19
+to June 30.</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-2">No testing was done on June 20 due to an attempt to install the
+new IMP system.</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-3">Several Hosts are currently excluded from the daily testing as
+they are presently intended to be users only. Included here are the
+Terminal IMPs, which are presently in the Network (AMES, MITRE, RADC,
+NBS, ETAC, USC, GWC, NOAA, SAAC, ARPA, and BBN*).  This category also
+includes the Network Control Center computer (Network address 5) which
+is used solely for gathering statistics from the Network. Finally,
+included among these Hosts are the following:</t>
